# Raster art is BUILD OUTPUT, not source.
#
# Every PNG below is rendered from ios/branding/swarm-appicon.svg by
# ios/scripts/generate-ios-art.sh, which the SWARM iOS workflow runs
# before xcodebuild. The repository carries the vector; the build carries
# the raster. Run the script once after cloning if you open the project in
# Xcode, or the asset catalog will report missing images.
Zingo/Images.xcassets/AppIcon-Prod.appiconset/*.png
Zingo/Images.xcassets/AppIcon-Beta.appiconset/*.png
Zingo/Images.xcassets/LaunchMark.imageset/*.png
